<title>USA: Unitel Video says received unsolicited bid.</title>
<headline>Unitel Video says received unsolicited bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitel Video Inc said on Tuesday that it received an unsolicted and non-binding &quot;expression of interest&quot; in acquiring the company, but that no formal offer had been extended to date.</p>
<p>While Unitel did not name the interested party, the company said it had held preliminary discusssions on the bid.</p>
<p>Unitel Video provides studio and mobile production facilities.</p>
</text>
